{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23054","headline":"送萧处士游黔南 · 白居易","name":"送萧处士游黔南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"能文好饮老萧郎，身似浮云鬓似霜。\n生计抛来诗是业，家园忘却酒爲乡。\n江从巴峡初成字，猨过巫阳始断肠。\n不醉黔中争去得，磨围山月正苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23054.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23054","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}